We don't have [? tasks ?]
[? around ?] with our notebook.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:46.990
We don't have anything
because we are different.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.450
In reality, this is just a tool.

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.580
There are some practices
there that specific

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:56.800
from Android Studio that
is for sure because it XML,

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.150
