00:25:09.200 --> 00:25:11.450
Now, certain item--

00:25:11.450 --> 00:25:14.650
Jupyter Notebooks should
be self-contained.

00:25:14.650 --> 00:25:18.880
And first, let me show
what possible to do

00:25:18.880 --> 00:25:21.366
