00:26:57.690 --> 00:27:00.320
Now, let's say you attach GPU.

00:27:00.320 --> 00:27:02.100
You're executing your training.

00:27:02.100 --> 00:27:03.680
Finally, you see a bug.

00:27:03.680 --> 00:27:06.230
You see a bug, you
need to debug this bug.

00:27:06.230 --> 00:27:08.960
While you're debugging, you
