VM under the hood.

00:27:51.110 --> 00:27:53.100
And it would be
nice when needed,

00:27:53.100 --> 00:27:56.880
when you actually want to train,
to spin up another something--

00:27:56.880 --> 00:27:59.510
another instance like
Deep Learning VM--

00:27:59.510 --> 00:28:01.730
that actually has GPUs.

00:28:01.730 --> 00:28:04.465
That small tiny icons
