00:28:26.240 --> 00:28:27.290
That is really nice.

00:28:27.290 --> 00:28:29.810
You're paying only for training.

00:28:29.810 --> 00:28:33.440
But in order to do so
because that second entity--

00:28:33.440 --> 00:28:34.970
