00:33:39.130 --> 00:33:41.560
back and destroyed the
back end [INAUDIBLE]..

00:33:41.560 --> 00:33:43.060
That is pretty simple.

00:33:43.060 --> 00:33:45.070
And pretty simple and it work.

00:33:45.070 --> 00:33:47.320
Now, we always were
saying that you

00:33:47.320 --> 00:33:48.670
