00:33:52.540 --> 00:33:55.030
What self-contained
means-- several things.

00:33:55.030 --> 00:33:57.220
Thing number one,
you need to have

00:33:57.220 --> 00:34:01.600
notion about which Deep Learning
VM, like TensorFlow M20,

00:34:01.600 --> 00:34:03.890
you have use for
creating notebook.

00:34:03.890 --> 00:34:06.400
Our Deep Learning
VM has already tons

00:34:06.400 --> 00:34:08.050
of different,
different packages.

00:34:08.050 --> 00:34:11.230
Very likely, you will not
need to install anything else.

00:34:11.230 --> 00:34:15.699
You can use [INAUDIBLE] NumPy,
[INAUDIBLE],, tons of them

00:34:15.699 --> 00:34:16.719
already there.

00:34:16.719 --> 00:34:19.230
But they have
different versions.

00:34:19.230 --> 00:34:22.150
So you need to make sure that
the notebook has information

00:34:22.150 --> 00:34:24.880
