with M19, M18.

00:34:24.880 --> 00:34:28.090
In this way, we
can spin up exactly

00:34:28.090 --> 00:34:31.560
that one Deep Learning VM
that has exactly the same set

00:34:31.560 --> 00:34:32.820
of packages and the version.

00:34:32.820 --> 00:34:34.510
This is number one.

00:34:34.510 --> 00:34:35.530
Number two is simple.

00:34:35.530 --> 00:34:37.600
If you do need an
dependency, please

00:34:37.600 --> 00:34:40.030
use magical cell inside
of the notebook that's

00:34:40.030 --> 00:34:40.840
installed there.

00:34:40.840 --> 00:34:41.687
That's it.

00:34:41.687 --> 00:34:44.020
I mean I don't understand
that there are some cases when

00:34:44.020 --> 00:34:45.187
