00:34:50.139 --> 00:34:52.750
In this case, we do
have several other ways.

00:34:52.750 --> 00:34:54.429
But in many cases you
will be surprised.

00:34:54.429 --> 00:34:56.889
Deep Learning VM already
have the majority

00:34:56.889 --> 00:34:58.330
of the things you need.

00:34:58.330 --> 00:35:00.250
You can just install
two packages.

00:35:00.250 --> 00:35:02.680
I don't know, maybe you
need MXNet for some reason.

00:35:02.680 --> 00:35:05.020
You can install it already.

00:35:05.020 --> 00:35:06.610
Just use magic
[? cell. ?] That is it.

00:35:06.610 --> 00:35:09.460
It's actually pretty simple.

00:35:09.460 --> 00:35:10.900
Now, limitations.

00:35:10.900 --> 00:35:13.810
Current limitations of
this particular script.

